    "body": "## New Features\r\n\r\n- **Fee analytics rework** — replaces the `mint_fees` snapshot API with a unified `listFees()` per-operation stream; CDK pulls fees from `completed_operations` via a proof join, nutshell LAG-diffs `balance_log` deltas; `fees_amount` now has its own dedicated checkpoint stream (was incorrectly aliased from `swaps_fee`, which is removed)\r\n- **Mint watchdog status** — new `mint_watchdog_status` GraphQL resolver reports nutshell `balance_log` liveness (`is_alive` + `last_seen`); dashboard overlays a warning when the watchdog goes stale\r\n- **Nutshell proto v0.20** — adds `GetQuoteTtl` RPC and `final_expiry` field to `RotateNextKeyset` request/response\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Per-keyset balance inflation** — `getMintAnalyticsKeysets` now nets `issued − redeemed` per bucket on the server; chart no longer mutates its input array\r\n- **Pre-query hour-floor** — `date_end` for the pre-range query now truncates to the start of the hour in both the dashboard and keysets components, preventing a bucket from being shared with the main range\r\n- **CDK fee join** — `listFees` switched from `blind_signature` to `proof` join so the keyset unit resolves from the input side (Cashu fees are charged on inputs)\r\n- **Postgres GROUP BY** — `CdkService.listFees` now lists all non-aggregated SELECT columns explicitly; Postgres can't infer PK functional dependency through the derived `co` subquery\r\n- **SQLite null params** — `queryRows`/`queryRow` now pass `params ?? []` instead of `undefined`, fixing broken WHERE clauses when no params are provided\r\n- **JWT schema-compile guard** — `jwt_mode` is guarded against `SCHEMA_ONLY=true` so `generate:types` no longer passes an empty string as the JWT secret\r\n- **Dashboard loading state** — `loading_mint` was not reset to `false` on analytics init or dynamic-update failure\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- **Keyset table headers** — \"Proofs\" / \"Promises\" renamed to \"Proof count\" / \"Promise count\"\r\n- **Nutshell RPC** — wired up missing RPC socket in nutshell compose stacks\r\n- **E2e bolt11 generation** — per-call generation replaces the fixed pre-baked invoice sidecar, eliminating duplicate `payment_hash` rejections on replay; CLN stacks use `lightning-cli invoice`, fake stacks use a bundled `gen-one-bolt11.js`\r\n- **cdk-cli send** — pins `--mint-url` to prevent interactive prompts in non-interactive `docker exec`\r\n- **Dep bumps** — `express-rate-limit` 8.3.1→8.5.1, `hono` 4.12.14→4.12.18\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- **4 new Playwright e2e specs** — `mint-general-keysets` (cache↔DB differential with `keysetCountsOracle`), `mint-subsection-dashboard`, `mint-subsection-info`, `mint-subsection-database` (backup/restore flow, invalid-filename blocking, malformed-file resilience)\r\n- **AI e2e spec** — `@ai` readiness probe, `aiIsHealthy` predicate, and a dashboard assistant spec gated behind a separate `e2e:test:ai` Playwright config and `e2e:sim:*` activity simulator scripts\r\n- **Unit tests** — `MintWatchdogService` liveness cases, `MintSubsectionKeysetsTableRow` balance arithmetic (including BigInt overflow), `MintAnalyticsService` keyset net issued−redeemed cases",
