    "body": "I propose adding a field to the dashboard for specitying the final expiry date of a keyset.\nThis would provide additional transparency and flexibility to Mint Operators and users alike.\n\nBy setting and explicit expiration date, Mint Operators can adjust users to repay their debt(ecash) more quickly, reducing the burden on the system. \n\nWith a fixed expiration date, operators can better plan and manage their finances, knowing exactly when each keyset will expire. This can also help reduce the risk of orphaned spend proofs.",
